#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:13
msgid "Following the basic configuration you will learn to assign permissions to agents and customer users and how to get started with the most usual CIs."
msgstr "基本設定に続いて、担当者と顧客ユーザーに権限を割り当てる方法と、よく使われる CI から始める方法を説明します。"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:16
msgid "Assign Permissions"
msgstr "権限の割り当て"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:17
msgid "Agents/customer users who need access to CIs of the CMDB have to be assigned to the group \"itsm-configitem\"."
msgstr "CMDB の CI にアクセスする必要がある担当者／顧客ユーザーは、グループ \"itsm-configitem\" に割り当てる必要があります。"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:20
msgid "Starting with the most usual CIs"
msgstr "よく使われる CI から始める"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:21
msgid "OTOBO provides the option to import class bundles showcasing the most usual CIs. To start with them please perform the following actions:"
msgstr "OTOBO には、よく使われる CI をまとめたクラスバンドルをインポートする機能があります。使い始めるには、次の操作を行ってください:"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:24
msgid "Open the admin-view of your OTOBO Web-UI."
msgstr "OTOBO の Web UI の管理画面を開きます。"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:25
msgid "Open \"Config Items\" in the section \"CMDB settings\"."
msgstr "\"CMDB settings\" セクションの \"Config Items\" を開きます。"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:0
msgid "Locate the \"Ready2Import Class Bundles\" panel on the left side and select the class bundle you want to import."
msgstr "左側の \"Ready2Import Class Bundles\" パネルを探し、インポートしたいクラスバンドルを選択します。"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:0
msgid ".. figure:: images/ready2import_class_bundles.png"
msgstr ".. figure:: images/ready2import_class_bundles.png"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:0
msgid ":alt: Ready2Import Class Bundles panel"
msgstr ":alt: Ready2Import Class Bundles パネル"

#: ../../content/configuration/basic_configuration.rst:29
msgid "Click the button to import the Ready2Adopt class bundles."
msgstr "ボタンをクリックして、Ready2Adopt クラスバンドルをインポートします。"

